                <mxCell id="painNote" value="Compared to today: &quot;Waiting&quot; used to be silence — where customers felt forgotten, got dropped, and were turned away. Now the 24h updates keep them reassured and the system keeps working the center, so the emotion holds steady (😌) instead of dropping into anxiety — and no one arrives without a valid work order." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff8e6;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
